      "text": "Maintaining Your Wave Music System\n• Check that the CD source is selected. The CD icon should appear on the display. If not, press CD. • Check that the CD was loaded label-side up. • Check that the disc surface is clean, If not, try cleaning it. • Check that an audio CD was loaded, not a DVD. • Try another disc.",
